  "mlp_c_export_procedure": [
    "Run unchanged a46_export_mlp_MIN.py with archived mlp_A16.joblib and an isolated output directory.",
    "Compile its header into a host shared library with cc -shared -fPIC -O2 -Wall -Wextra -Wcast-qual and -lm.",
    "Use original A16 training feature functions and archived scaler/PCA to obtain 81 float32 input vectors from the reconstructed test windows.",
    "Pass each writable vector to A16_MLP_predict with two separate 64-float scratch arrays; compare first result with sklearn; record input mutation and call again without restoring input.",
    "The generated buffer swap assigns a=(float*)x_in after the first layer. The next layer writes to the caller input. tmp1 is never used."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Original historical manifests remain absent; regenerated manifests are reconstructions.",
